  "prefLabel": "Rev 1501.13 Railroad company",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1501.13 \"Railroad company\" means every corporation, company association, joint stock association, partnership, and person, their lessees, trustees, or receivers appointed by any court, owning railroad company assets in New Hampshire, or operating any railroad for common carriage of passengers or freight or carrying on a public express business for compensation over the line of any railroad.\n\nSource. #10662, eff 8-27-14 (from Rev 1501.07); ss by #13977, eff 5-23-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev1500.html"
